sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / Reporter
    participant Inc as IncidentService (Stefania)
    participant Pub as ApplicationEventPublisher (Spring)
    participant List as LocalAssetDamagedListener (Calin)
    participant Reass as ReassignmentService (Calin)
    participant Cat as CatalogApi (Liviu)
    participant Res as ReservationApi / ReservationService (Calin)
    participant Strat as SubstituteStrategy (Calin)
    participant Log as ReassignmentLogRepository (Calin)
    participant Notif as NotificationService (Liviu)

    User->>Inc: reportIncident(assetId, description, severity)
    activate Inc
    Inc->>Cat: markUnderMaintenance(assetId)
    Inc->>Pub: publishEvent(AssetDamagedEvent)
    Note over Inc,Pub: Incident transaction commits
    deactivate Inc

    Pub->>List: on(AssetDamagedEvent) (AFTER_COMMIT)
    activate List
    List->>Reass: handle(event)
    deactivate List

    activate Reass
    Note over Reass: @Transactional(REQUIRES_NEW)
    Reass->>Cat: getAsset(event.assetId)
    Cat-->>Reass: damaged AssetSummary
    Reass->>Res: findUpcomingActiveByAsset(event.assetId, now)
    Res-->>Reass: List<ReservationSummary>

    loop For each upcoming booking (chronological)
        Reass->>Strat: findSubstitute(booking, damaged)
        activate Strat
        Note over Strat: Strategy 1: SameModelStrategy (@Order 1)<br/>Strategy 2: SameCategoryStrategy (@Order 2)
        Strat->>Cat: findAvailableByModel(...) / findAvailableByCategory(...)
        Cat-->>Strat: candidate assets
        Strat->>Res: isAssetFree(candidateId, start, end, bookingId)
        Res-->>Strat: boolean free
        Strat-->>Reass: Optional<AssetSummary>
        deactivate Strat

        alt Substitute asset found
            Reass->>Res: moveToAsset(bookingId, candidateId, reason)
            Reass->>Log: save(ReassignmentLog[outcome=REASSIGNED, strategy=...])
            Reass->>Notif: notifyUser(userId, "Reservation moved to substitute asset")
        else No substitute available
            Reass->>Res: forceCancel(bookingId, reason)
            Reass->>Log: save(ReassignmentLog[outcome=FORCE_CANCELLED, reason=...])
            Reass->>Notif: notifyUser(userId, "Reservation cancelled due to damaged asset")
        end
    end
    Note over Reass: Reassignment transaction commits
    deactivate Reass
